{"seq":36,"slug":"pathfinding-navigation-mesh","title":"寻路与导航网格","stage":"DONE","category":"game-development","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/pathfinding-navigation-mesh","rating":{"composite":4.04,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":5,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"寻路与导航网格-总览\">寻路与导航网格·总览</h1><p>一个 NPC 要从城堡门口走到广场喷泉，玩家眼里只是一段顺滑的移动；引擎背后却要回答四个层层递进的问题：世界长什么样、最短路怎么算、该贴着哪条几何边走、走的过程里如何不撞墙也不撞人。这个 hub 就沿着这条链条展开——从<strong>搜索算法</strong>到<strong>导航网格</strong>，再到<strong>移动与转向</strong>，最后落到<strong>实践优化</strong>，把&quot;会动的角色&quot;这件事拆成可独立打磨的工程层。</p>\n<p>第一条主线是基础。寻路的本质是图搜索：把连续世界离散成节点与边，用 A* 在其上找代价最小的路径，而 A* 跑得好不好，几乎全系于启发函数是否可采纳、是否一致。这三篇（搜索与图表示、A* 算法、启发函数与可采纳性）是后面一切的算法底座，先把它们读透，后面的网格寻路、分层寻路才不会变成黑盒。</p>\n<p>第二条主线是导航网格。把世界离散成栅格简单但粗糙，3D 游戏更常用导航网格（navmesh）——用凸多边形覆盖可行走表面，由 Recast 这类工具体素化生成，再用 Detour 在其上查询。在多边形序列里求真正的最短折线，靠的是漏斗算法（funnel）。当门被炸开、桥被放下，navmesh 还得局部重建并触发重规划。这一章把&quot;几何&quot;这一层讲透。</p>\n<p>第三条主线是移动与转向。搜索给出的是一串路点，而不是角色每一帧该往哪走。路径要平滑、要被跟随，角色要用转向行为（seek/arrive/path following）把路点翻译成加速度，多个角色挤在一起时还要用 RVO/ORCA 做局部避让。这一层决定了移动&quot;看起来像不像活物&quot;。</p>\n<p>第四条主线是实践。大地图上每帧上千次查询扛不住，于是有分层寻路（HPA*）把问题切成抽象层；成百上千单位同时奔向同一目标时，与其每个单位各算各的，不如用流场（flow field）一次性算出全图方向。最后用一篇专门讲性能预算、分帧、缓存与调试，把工程现实补齐。</p>\n<p><strong>本 hub 与兄弟 hub <a href=\"../game-ai/\">游戏 AI</a> 的分工边界</strong>要先说清楚。03_game-ai 关心的是<strong>决策层</strong>——NPC 用有限状态机、行为树、效用 AI <strong>决定</strong>去哪、做什么；本 hub 关心的是决策之后的<strong>执行层</strong>——既然决定了去喷泉，&quot;怎么算出路、怎么走过去、怎么不撞人&quot;全归这里。两边在 A*、navmesh、转向行为上有概念重叠，但 03 是点到为止的入门视角，本 hub 是把每个算法的可采纳性证明、漏斗几何、ORCA 半平面、流场积分讲到能落地实现的深度视角。需要&quot;角色为什么做这个决定&quot;去 03；需要&quot;决定之后怎么精确地移动到位&quot;留在这里。</p>\n<p><strong>推荐学习路径</strong>。若你是初次接触寻路的程序员：严格按 1→2→3→4 章顺序读，每章内按编号读，基础三篇务必读懂可采纳性再往下。若你已经写过 A*、只缺工程落地：可直接从第二章导航网格切入，再跳到第四章实践，回头补第三章转向。若你在做 RTS 或群体场景：基础读完后重点攻第三章局部避让与第四章流场，这两块是群体寻路的胜负手。</p>\n<p><strong>前置知识</strong>：能读 C++/C# 伪代码、熟悉基本数据结构（优先队列、图、哈希表）、了解二维向量运算（点积、叉积、向量投影）。不需要图形学或物理引擎背景，但读过 <a href=\"../game-physics/collision-detection/bounding-volumes\">碰撞检测</a> 对理解动态障碍与避让会有帮助。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/pathfinding-navigation-mesh/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"search-graph-representation","title":"搜索与图表示","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/pathfinding-navigation-mesh/foundations/search-graph-representation"},{"seq":2,"slug":"a-star-algorithm","title":"A* 算法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/pathfinding-navigation-mesh/foundations/a-star-algorithm"},{"seq":3,"slug":"heuristics-admissibility","title":"启发函数与可采纳性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/pathfinding-navigation-mesh/foundations/heuristics-admissibility"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"navigation-meshes","title":"导航网格","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/pathfinding-navigation-mesh/navigation-meshes","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"navmesh-generation","title":"导航网格生成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/pathfinding-navigation-mesh/navigation-meshes/navmesh-generation"},{"seq":2,"slug":"navmesh-funnel-pathfinding","title":"网格寻路与漏斗算法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/pathfinding-navigation-mesh/navigation-meshes/navmesh-funnel-pathfinding"},{"seq":3,"slug":"dynamic-obstacles-replan","title":"动态障碍与重规划","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/pathfinding-navigation-mesh/navigation-meshes/dynamic-obstacles-replan"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"movement","title":"移动与转向","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/pathfinding-navigation-mesh/movement","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"path-smoothing-following","title":"路径平滑与跟随","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/pathfinding-navigation-mesh/movement/path-smoothing-following"},{"seq":2,"slug":"steering-behaviors","title":"转向行为","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/pathfinding-navigation-mesh/movement/steering-behaviors"},{"seq":3,"slug":"local-avoidance-rvo","title":"局部避让 RVO/ORCA","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/pathfinding-navigation-mesh/movement/local-avoidance-rvo"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"practice","title":"实践","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/pathfinding-navigation-mesh/practice","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"hierarchical-pathfinding","title":"分层寻路","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/pathfinding-navigation-mesh/practice/hierarchical-pathfinding"},{"seq":2,"slug":"flow-fields-crowds","title":"流场与群体寻路","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/pathfinding-navigation-mesh/practice/flow-fields-crowds"},{"seq":3,"slug":"pathfinding-optimization","title":"性能优化与调试","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/pathfinding-navigation-mesh/practice/pathfinding-optimization"}]}]}